 with discrimination\nagainst illegitimate but\nhere its rational to say\nlittle burden to prove\nsupport\n\nMarshall, J. Agree with BRW\nThis is expectancy of support\ncase — if father found\nto be such or he\nacknowledges paternity\ncan properly expect\nsupport but this\nlad lost nothing\nwhen man died because\nbecause he had no\nexpectancy of support</pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1975 term</p><h2>Tennessee et al. v. Dunlap</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/3a6a7dc0-850f-49d8-93ca-37b207f087a5.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/2250\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre><span class=\"wait\">No writing on this page.</span></pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">1975 term &nbsp;/&nbsp; notes taken by Harry A. Blackmun</p><h2>Beer et al. v. United States et al.</h2></div><div class=\"pager\"><span class=\"count\"></span><button data-step=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Previous\">&#8249;</button><button data-step=\"1\" aria-label=\"Next\">&#8250;</button></div></div>\n<div class=\"spread\"><div class=\"sheet\"><img src=\"https://panoptes-uploads.zooniverse.org/subject_location/329d16f1-45aa-41d8-ae8b-08d475bfff3a.jpeg\" class=\"z\" alt=\"The full page\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1500/2250\" decoding=\"async\"></div>\n<div class=\"boxes\"><article class=\"box\"><div class=\"pair single\"><div class=\"r r1\"><h4>Whole page</h4><pre>White, J. +\n\nMarshall, J. +\n\nPowell, J. —\n\nRehnquist, J. —</pre></div></div></article></div></div>","<div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"kick